forts, is that 0.8 heads of Aircraft Test Director (the average of DCS S-70M and DCS S-70i, (0.76+0.84) / 2 = 0.8 heads) will be required.\r\n\r\nRemoved 4.3 weeks due to reduction from 22 to 10 flight hours.  Also, brought WI up to full time from 0.8 time due to test at Stewart and no multi-task with other DFC projects.\r\n1.0 WI x 40 hrs/wk x 8.5 weeks = 340 hours ", CamName = "Stange, B. ", Category = "ENG", TieredPercentage = 1.3m},
                new ProjectMapModelView { ClassOfCost = ClassOfCost.Recurring.ToDescription(), WbsNumber = "2.06.01.01", CostCenter = "xxyy", ActivityID = "BSW1203", ActivityName = "2018 System Safety Management Support", WbsElementTitle = "System Safety Management Support", InitialResource = "4049B", StartDate = DateTime.Parse("01/02/2018"), EndDate = DateTime.Parse("12/24/2018"), Clin = "0001", SowNumber = "3.1.11", SowTitle = "System Safety Management", Task = "The Contractor shall provide system safety updates during FMS PPRs (conducted twice a year)\r\nfor the duration of the Tunisia aircraft program. This requirement shall be combined for all other\r\nsimilar FMS system safety management contract requirements. The Contractor updates shall\r\ncover the Contractor and USG released messages to include Airworthiness Directives (ADs),\r\nService Bulletins (SBs), Alert Service Bulletins (ASBs), Safety Of Flight (SOF) messages,\r\nAviation Safety Action Messages (ASAMs), and Aviation Maintenance Action Messages\r\n(AMAMs) over the previous six months and the actions that the Contractor executed for each\r\nmessage for each FMS program contract that has this requirement.", Hours = 68, Dollars = 0, Rationale = "Based on Actuals of 40.1 hrs (WBS EV-BLX.2.06.01.01.00.001 (33.8 hrs) + EV-BLX.2.06.01.01.00.003 (6.3 hrs)) on similar S70M-09 Program charged over a 7 month period for System Engineering Support.  A similar level of effort is estimated for the duration of the Bahrain program as follows:\r\n\r\n40 hrs / 7 months = 5.7 hrs per month\r\n2018 Effort: 12 months X 5.7 hrs = 68\r\n2019 Effort: 12 months X 5.7 hrs = 68\r\n2020 Effort: 10 months X 5.7 hrs = 57\r\n\r\n", CamName = "Sawyer(Gerstein)", Category = "ENG", TieredPercentage = 1.3m},
